From: axon7m bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: software_isp: debayer_cpu: NV12 output

Android's camera HAL needs NV12/NV21 for YCbCr_420_888 and
IMPLEMENTATION_DEFINED streams and encodes JPEG from NV12; gralloc gives
camera preview buffers in NV12. The CPU debayer only wrote RGB. Debayer each
pair of lines into a small RGB buffer and store it as two luma lines and one
line of interleaved chroma (BT.601 limited range, chroma averaged over 2x2).
Only for 2-line Bayer patterns and even sizes.
